    "language": "[0]I will wait to receive the ball before making a decision. Precondition, I will check my passing options, prioritizing forward players. Both strikers are blocked, so I will check the left winger. The path is clear. [1]Now, I will move to a supporting position. Uh,[2] this is incorrect. Look, the coach[3] is in the same line as defender[4] two and left-winger,[5] [6]so this is not the supporting[7] position[8] 'cause coach is blocked[9] by defender.[10] So, uh,[11] coach should go closer to the left-winger, maybe[12] here, [13]here, or here,[14] so that there is a possibility to pass. Also, in the [15]previous system demonstration, I saw that sometimes [16]coach would not pass to [17]the left striker, or right[18] striker, in the beginning, um, while they were clearly open. So,[19] [20]that was also something incorrect.[21]",
